        <ul>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/bcgit/bc-java/commit/2c28b253a44681fbbc562561eab6ad383d2ae558">GitHub Commit</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/bcgit/bc-java/wiki/CVE%E2%80%902026%E2%80%908763">GitHub Wiki</a></li>
        </ul>

